<title>INDIA: CRICKET-SOUTH.AFRICA 339-2 AT CLOSE V INDIA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SOUTH.AFRICA 339-2 AT CLOSE V INDIA.</headline>
<dateline>CALCUTTA, India 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa were 339</p>
<p>for two at the close on the first day of the second test against</p>
<p>India at Eden Gardens on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
